@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Happy and failure paths for one external attempt
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

actor User
participant "Effect owner" as O
database "Durable intent / attempt" as D
participant "Actual adapter" as A
participant Provider as P
User -> O : explicit reviewed intent
O -> D : coherently record attributable intent
O -> A : current eligible attempt
A -> P : dispatch exact reviewed operation
alt attributable acceptance observed
 P --> A : actual acceptance evidence
 A -> D : record under current claim guard
else authoritative no-effect rejection
 P --> A : actual rejection
 A -> D : record confirmed rejection
else response absent / ambiguous
 A -> D : retain unknown effect; same attempt
 loop bounded observation only if supported and currently authorized
  A -> P : observe same attributable attempt
  P --> A : actual evidence or unavailable
 end
 opt uncertainty remains
  O --> User : safe unresolved reference / intervention route
 end
end
O --> User : truthful permitted outcome

@enduml
